    <string name="about_tech_stack">Tech Stack</string>
    <string name="about_terms_content">ClawDroid is a personal AI assistant app.\n\nThis app processes user data on device and communicates with servers only when cloud AI models are used.\n\nUsers are responsible for checking the accuracy of AI responses generated by the app.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_content">ClawDroid respects user privacy.\n\n• Conversation data: encrypted and stored on device\n• API keys: stored securely with EncryptedSharedPreferences\n• Cloud AI: conversation content may be sent to a server when used\n• On-device AI: processed locally without network access\n• Channel data: only messages from connected channels are processed\n\nUsers can delete all data at any time.</string>
    <string name="about_open_source_content">This app uses the following open source libraries:\n\n• AndroidX (Apache 2.0)\n• Material Components (Apache 2.0)\n• Room Database (Apache 2.0)\n• Hilt / Dagger (Apache 2.0)\n• RxJava 3 (Apache 2.0)\n• Retrofit / OkHttp (Apache 2.0)\n• Glide (BSD / Apache 2.0)\n• Markwon (Apache 2.0)\n• Jsoup (MIT)\n• Gson (Apache 2.0)</string>

